{"page":15,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:94","surah":2,"ayah":94,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ إِن كَانَتْ لَكُمُ ٱلدَّارُ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةُ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ خَالِصَةً مِّن دُونِ ٱلنَّاسِ فَتَمَنَّوُا۟ ٱلْمَوْتَ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰدِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘If the last home with God is to be for you alone and no one else, then you should long for death, if your claim is true.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If ","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَانَتْ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kānat","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَكُمُ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakumu","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلدَّارُ","en_gloss":"the home","transliteration":"l-dāru","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةُ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhiratu","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":9,"ar":"خَالِصَةًۭ","en_gloss":"exclusively","transliteration":"khāliṣatan","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":11,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"excluding","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَتَمَنَّوُا۟","en_gloss":"then wish","transliteration":"fatamannawū","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَ","en_gloss":"(for) [the] death","transliteration":"l-mawta","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":16,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you are","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":17,"ar":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","en_gloss":"truthful","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","verse_key":"2:94"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٩٤","en_gloss":"(94)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:94"}]},{"verse_key":"2:95","surah":2,"ayah":95,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَن يَتَمَنَّوْهُ أَبَدًۢا بِمَا قَدَّمَتْ أَيْدِيهِمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌۢ بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But they will never long for death, because of what they have stored up with their own hands: God is fully aware of the evildoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَن","en_gloss":"And never (will)","transliteration":"walan","verse_key":"2:95"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَتَمَنَّوْهُ","en_gloss":"they wish for it","transliteration":"yatamannawhu","verse_key":"2:95"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَبَدًۢا","en_gloss":"ever","transliteration":"abadan","verse_key":"2:95"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"2:95"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَدَّمَتْ","en_gloss":"(of what) sent ahead","transliteration":"qaddamat","verse_key":"2:95"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَيْدِيهِمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"their hands","transliteration":"aydīhim","verse_key":"2:95"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"2:95"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"2:95"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"of the wrongdoers","transliteration":"bil-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"2:95"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٩٥","en_gloss":"(95)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:95"}]},{"verse_key":"2:96","surah":2,"ayah":96,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَتَجِدَنَّهُمْ أَحْرَصَ ٱلنَّاسِ عَلَىٰ حَيَوٰةٍ وَمِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوا۟ ۚ يَوَدُّ أَحَدُهُمْ لَوْ يُعَمَّرُ أَلْفَ سَنَةٍ وَمَا هُوَ بِمُزَحْزِحِهِۦ مِنَ ٱلْعَذَابِ أَن يُعَمَّرَ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ بَصِيرٌۢ بِمَا يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], you are sure to find them clinging to life more eagerly than any other people, even the polytheists. Any of them would wish to be given a life of a thousand years, though even such a long life would not save them from the torment: God sees everything they do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَتَجِدَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"And surely you will find them","transliteration":"walatajidannahum","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَحْرَصَ","en_gloss":"(the) most greedy","transliteration":"aḥraṣa","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"(of) [the] mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَيَوٰةٍۢ","en_gloss":"life","transliteration":"ḥayatin","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"and (greedier) than","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَشْرَكُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"associate[d] partners (with Allah)","transliteration":"ashrakū","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَوَدُّ","en_gloss":"Loves","transliteration":"yawaddu","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَحَدُهُمْ","en_gloss":"(each) one of them","transliteration":"aḥaduhum","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُعَمَّرُ","en_gloss":"he could be granted a life","transliteration":"yuʿammaru","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَلْفَ","en_gloss":"(of) a thousand","transliteration":"alfa","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":14,"ar":"سَنَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"year(s)","transliteration":"sanatin","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"But not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":16,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِمُزَحْزِحِهِۦ","en_gloss":"(will) remove him","transliteration":"bimuzaḥziḥihi","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:96"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يُعَمَّرَ ۗ","en_gloss":"he